  "description": "Qdrant storage for Mythosia VectorDb with Cosine, Euclidean and Dot Product similarity, metadata filtering and automatic collection provisioning. Supports sparse-only text retrieval, configurable normalized weighted RRF and direct native sparse/dense hybrid fusion with server RRF or DBSF. Uses a single collection with metadata-based logical isolation and provides batch retrieval, counts and connection verification. What's New in v4.2.0: Sparse text and configurable hybrid search with literal metadata-key filtering.",
