  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v4.2.0: Adds sparse-only text queries and configurable normalized weighted RRF while retaining configured server RRF/DBSF for direct legacy hybrid calls. Treats flat metadata keys literally and excludes missing fields from Ne/NotIn. New text/configurable-hybrid paths support equality, membership, existence and nested groups; unsupported string range/LIKE filters and unrepresentable keys fail explicitly. No stored payload migration is required. Uses System.IO.Hashing 10.0.7. Full notes: https://github.com/AJ-comp/Mythosia.AI/blob/main/src/vectordb/Mythosia.VectorDb.Qdrant/RELEASE_NOTES.md#v420",
